# The heavy B&A crypto binaries are NOT committed (~120 MB total). They live as
# an OCI artifact in the container registry (anonymous pull) and are fetched with
# scripts/fetch_libs.sh (see README). Kept out of git:
#   * Azure fork (python backend): lib/libsecure_invoke.so (~72 MB) + lib/libcddl.so
#   * GCP fork (native backend):   native/bin/invoke (~40 MB) + native/lib/libcddl.so
src/depa_secure_invoke/lib/*.so
